&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, HR Technology &amp;amp; Solutions Delivery is a senior technology leadership role responsible for the strategy, design, delivery, operation and evolution of Inizio&#39;s global HR technology ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the near term, the role has significant accountability for Workday, leading day-to-day IT operations, functional solution design, enhancements, continuous improvement and strategic HR technology projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over time, the role will evolve HR Technology towards a stronger platform engineering and architecture-led model, establishing the technical strategy, engineering practices, integration architecture, governance, security and operational capabilities required to support Inizio at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This requires a leader who can operate across both the functional and technical dimensions of Workday – translating HR requirements into effective solutions while bringing the technical depth and engineering mindset to shape the future HR technology landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have end-to-end IT accountability for Workday and the wider HR technology ecosystem. The Workday IT Operations team will report directly to this role, which reports to the Deputy Chief Information Officer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workday Platform, Operations &amp;amp; Functional Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide end-to-end IT ownership of Workday, covering functional design, configuration, operations, support, enhancements and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR People Services and Centres of Excellence to translate business requirements into scalable, sustainable Workday solutions aligned with global standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide senior oversight of Workday business processes, configuration, security, reporting, integrations and adoption of new platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the Workday IT Operations team, ensuring effective management of incidents, requests, defects, changes, enhancements and releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish effective service levels, operational KPIs, demand and backlog management, root-cause analysis, testing, documentation and operational controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement, automation and proactive platform management to improve user experience, reliability and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior escalation and decision point for significant Workday functional, technical and operational matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Technology Project &amp;amp; Solutions Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HR Technology Strategy: Own end-to-end technology delivery of significant Workday and wider HR technology initiatives, from requirements and solution design through build, integration, testing, deployment, stabilisation and BAU transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Workday enhancements, module implementations, optimisation initiatives and HR transformation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure solutions align with business outcomes, architecture principles and the longer-term HR technology roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish delivery governance across scope, plans, dependencies, resources, risks, quality and budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold systems integrators and delivery partners accountable for delivery, solution quality, knowledge transfer and sustainable support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technology strategy, target architecture and multi-year roadmap for Inizio&#39;s global HR technology ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish architecture and engineering principles across platforms, integrations, APIs, data, identity, security, environments, testing, deployment, monitoring and operational resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the progressive evolution of HR Technology towards a stronger platform engineering operating model, increasing automation, standardisation and engineering discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure HR technology is scalable, secure, resilient, maintainable and aligned with Inizio&#39;s wider enterprise technology strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage technical debt and identify opportunities to simplify and modernise the HR technology estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop internal technical capability and reduce unnecessary reliance on external partners for core platform knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrations, Security &amp;amp; Technical Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical governance across HR technology architecture, integrations, security and change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure secure and reliable connectivity between Workday, HR applications, enterprise platforms, identity services, data platforms and external providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish appropriate integration patterns, APIs, middleware and data standards, reducing unnecessary point-to-point connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure appropriate controls across cyber security, data privacy, identity and access management, privileged access, segregation of duties and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed security, risk and compliance requirements into solution design and delivery and maintain appropriate controls and audit evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Enterprise Architecture, Cyber Security, Data and Integration teams to ensure HR technology aligns with enterprise standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vendor, Commercial &amp;amp; HR Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the senior IT partner to HR leadership, translating HR strategy and operational priorities into an actionable technology roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with HR People Services and Centres of Excellence to shape solutions and prioritise BAU enhancements, projects and strategic investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance on Workday capabilities and wider opportunities including automation, AI and emerging HR technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage strategic relationships with Workday, technology vendors, systems integrators and specialist partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold partners accountable for technical capability, solution quality, service, delivery and commercial outcomes and provide technology leadership for vendor selection and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Capability Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a high-performing HR Technology team with the right balance of Workday functional, technical, integration, engineering and operational capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the technical maturity of the function through coaching, standards and strong engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster collaboration across HR, Enterprise Architecture, Cyber Security, Data, Integration and wider IT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a culture of ownership, customer focus, engineering quality, accountability and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a visible and credible senior technology leader across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an experienced HR technology leader who combines strong Workday functional and delivery expertise with technical depth and an engineering mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand how Workday supports end-to-end HR processes and can lead functional solution design and delivery, while being equally comfortable discussing integrations, architecture, security, engineering and enterprise technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading Workday in a complex enterprise environment across functional design, BAU operations, enhancements and project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Workday functional solution-design expertise across multiple areas, with an understanding of HCM processes, configuration, security, reporting, integrations and data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering significant Workday implementations, module deployments, transformations or optimisation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of enterprise integrations, APIs, middleware, data integration and connectivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of platform engineering practices including testing, deployment, monitoring, automation and operational resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of application security, identity and access management, technology risk, data privacy and change controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing effective technical and functional governance for enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success managing systems integrators, vendors and strategic partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and leading multidisciplinary technology teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder-management skills across HR and Technology leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Critically, you will be comfortable operating across the full spectrum from Workday functional design and day-to-day platform decisions through to enterprise architecture and technology strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Desirable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Manager, Director or equivalent experience within a global organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience across Workday HCM and multiple Workday modules, supported by Workday certifications and/or demonstrable functional and technical expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading global Workday deployments, optimisation programmes or major HR transformations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within consulting, technology, pharmaceutical, life sciences or another complex multinational environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience introducing platform engineering, DevOps, automation or product-oriented ways of working into enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inizio, we want you to feel supported both professionally and personally. Our benefits are designed to support your health, wellbeing and financial future, while giving you flexibility in how you work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your location and employing entity, our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Healthcare&lt;/strong&gt; – access to private healthcare or a healthcare allowance, depending on your location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension&lt;/strong&gt; – a company-supported pension scheme with employer contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Leave&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days&#39; annual leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working&lt;/strong&gt; – a flexible working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life Insurance&lt;/strong&gt; – cover of 4x your basic salary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Income Protection&lt;/strong&gt; – up to 75% of your basic salary in the event of eligible long-term sickness or absence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&lt;/strong&gt; – confidential support for personal, work and wellbeing concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cycle to Work&lt;/strong&gt; – support towards the cost of a bike and cycling equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Wellbeing &amp;amp; Lifestyle Benefits&lt;/strong&gt; – additional benefits may include eyecare, wellbeing resources and employee discounts, depending on your location and employing entity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits vary by location and employing entity. We will provide full details during the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Inizio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inizio, we&#39;re a global team motivated by a shared purpose: to reimagine health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Formed in 2022, we unite decades of experience and expertise with data, technology, and AI. We create tailored solutions that drive Intelligent Commercialization™ at every stage of the journey, from discovery to post-launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our global network of over 10,000 experts operates across 50 countries, supporting clients with strategic insight, medical excellence, creative engagement, and real-world delivery. We work with the world&#39;s leading health and life sciences businesses to solve complex challenges and accomplish meaningful outcomes for our clients and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What sets Inizio apart is our people - and we believe everyone should excel. Here, you&#39;re encouraged to reimagine your possibilities: to grow, to be curious and to make change happen. We value your individuality, support your development, and celebrate your ambition. If you&#39;re ready to push boundaries and accelerate your career, Inizio is the best place to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Pledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inizio, we value inclusivity, recognize the power of diversity and inspire the next generation of change-makers. We are an equal opportunities employer. We believe in creating a dynamic work environment that values diversity, equity and inclusion. We aim to recruit from a diverse slate of candidates and foster an environment that provides the right conditions for long-term success. We welcome all applications. We consider them regardless of race, color, religion, or belief. We also consider them regardless of gender, gender identity, age, national origin, marital status, military veteran status, genetic information, sexual orientation, and physical or mental disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inizio may use AI technologies to support certain aspects of our recruitment process, but our human recruiting team makes all hiring decisions. We are committed to fair, inclusive, and human-led hiring practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DT2 #LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every job requirement? That&#39;s okay! Our company is dedicated to building an inclusive and authentic workplace. If you&#39;re excited about this role, but your experience doesn&#39;t perfectly fit every qualification, we encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right person for this role or others.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Twilio, we’re shaping the future of communications, all from the comfort of our homes. We deliver innovative solutions to&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://customers.twilio.com/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;hundreds of thousands of businesses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and empower millions of developers worldwide to craft personalized customer experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our dedication to &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/en-us/blog/open-work&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;remote-first work&lt;/a&gt;, and strong culture of connection and global inclusion means that no matter your location, you’re part of a vibrant team with diverse experiences making a global impact each day. As we continue to revolutionize how the world interacts, we’re acquiring new skills and experiences that make work feel truly rewarding. Your career at Twilio is in your hands.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring and how we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use Artificial Intelligence (AI) to help make our hiring process efficient. That said, every hiring decision is made by real Twilions!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also, while we are a remote-first company, you may be asked to report in person on an ad-hoc basis for team gatherings, functional off-sites or customer meetings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;See yourself at Twilio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team as Twilio’s next Strategic Account Executive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is needed to sell into high value prospects and customers. This person will play a key role in further growing the business across EMEA with a particular focus on Northern Europe. The candidate will be responsible for managing fast growing customers in the region. Focused mainly on Product cross and up-sell and revenue growth, as well as sourcing net new opportunities within a set of accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Servicing the fastest growing customers in the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growing our revenue and share of wallet within your key account list.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opening doors to the purchase of Twilio’s products and services - including voice, messaging, email, contact centre, account security software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining the highest levels of customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create pricing proposals, negotiating terms and managing the contract process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selling solutions to a technical and business audience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building trust and mutual respect with technical customers and peers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinking outside of the box and having extraordinary interpersonal and communication skills to make complex contractual, technical, and financial details sound simple.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balancing challenging priorities and handling multiple projects/deals at the same time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Twilio values diverse experiences from all kinds of industries, and we encourage everyone who meets the required qualifications to apply. If your career is just starting or hasn&#39;t followed a traditional path, don&#39;t let that stop you from considering Twilio. We are always looking for people who will bring something new to the table!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of Account Management/Sales experience covering selling and closing complex technical solutions to a large customer base.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of working with accounts ranging from large multinational enterprise customers to Digital Natives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining relationships up to C-suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success by achieving quota on a consistent basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of Account Management experience and a solid understanding of how to cross and upsell solutions within a mature customer base.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of financial reporting within a direct customer base - Revenue tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling both to a business and technical stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and understanding of working in the communications market is preferable.&amp;nbsp; Have sold or worked with Messaging, Voice, Email, Contact Centre, Account Security Verification.&amp;nbsp; Or have prior experience in a traditional telecommunications environment/business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious networker&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position will be remote and based in the United Kingdom or Ireland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We prioritize connection and opportunities to build relationships with our customers and each other. For this role, approximately 25%&amp;nbsp; travel is anticipated to help you connect in-person in a meaningful way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Twilio offers many benefits, including competitive pay, generous time off, ample parental and wellness leave, healthcare, a retirement savings program, and much more. Offerings vary by location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Twilio thinks big. Do you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We like to solve problems, take initiative, pitch in when needed, and are always up for trying new things. That&#39;s why we seek out colleagues who embody our values — something we call &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/company/values&quot;&gt;Twilio Magic&lt;/a&gt;. Additionally, we empower employees to build &lt;a href=&quot;https://twilio.org/support-and-resources/impact-fund&quot;&gt;positive change in their communities&lt;/a&gt; by supporting their volunteering and donation efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So, if you&#39;re ready to unleash your full potential, do your best work, and be the best version of yourself, apply now! If this role isn&#39;t what you&#39;re looking for, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.twilio.com/company/jobs#open-positions&quot;&gt;please consider other open positions.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay alert to recruitment fraud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care about your safety. Scammers sometimes impersonate Twilio recruiters through fake job postings, emails, websites, or messages. Please ensure you are engaging with an official @&lt;a href=&quot;http://twilio.com&quot;&gt;twilio.com&lt;/a&gt; email address. We will never ask for payment, gift cards, cryptocurrency, or banking information during the recruiting process. We do not make job offers without a formal interview process or conduct interviews exclusively through text-based messaging apps.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Twilio is proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt; We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics. We also consider qualified applicants with criminal histories, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law. Qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records will be considered for employment in accordance with the Los Angeles County Fair Chance Ordinance for Employers and the California Fair Chance Act. Additionally, Twilio participates in the E-Verify program in certain locations, as required by law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; is a leading AI-powered performance marketing platform for the mobile app economy. Our end-to-end technology stack helps app marketers acquire and retain high-value users, while enabling publishers to maximize revenue across programmatic and direct demand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff’s solutions, including Accelerate, Direct, Monetize, Intelligence, and Vungle Exchange, support over 6,600 mobile businesses across 74 countries in sectors such as gaming, social, finance, ecommerce, and entertainment. Founded in 2012 and headquartered in Redwood City, CA, Liftoff has a diverse, global presence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this team:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Liftoff, the View Master team plays a crucial role in the company&#39;s success. Our team builds mobile SDKs (iOS, Android, Windows), and systems that connect Liftoff’s publishers with advertisers, managing applications, campaigns, and creatives that feed into our ad serving pipeline. We create innovative advertisements viewed by millions daily, ensuring a seamless user experience and optimizing ad performance.&amp;nbsp; We&#39;re a group of innovative engineers who leverage the latest technology to develop efficient and scalable systems. If you&#39;re passionate about building and scaling low-latency, high-throughput systems, we&#39;d be delighted to speak with you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical direction for new ad format development in the SDK, driving decisions on native/web architecture and cross-platform compatibility without needing detailed direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently scope and lead ambiguous, cross-team initiatives from problem definition through rollout — e.g., overhauling automation quality and creative/SDK interoperability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive multi-quarter improvements to system efficiency, reliability, and rendering performance, owning tradeoffs between short- and long-term solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and evangelize testing strategy and standards (unit, integration, automated) across the team, not just execute against existing practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and drive experimentation and canary-release strategy for ad unit performance, including recommending which approaches to pursue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically lead and mentor other engineers on the team, including guiding junior/mid-level engineers&#39; project work and growth (not just informal mentorship)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the team in cross-functional and roadmap discussions, influencing prioritization and scope rather than only attending for alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold and help define the team&#39;s engineering bar for code quality, security/privacy, cost efficiency, and production hygiene (oncall, monitoring, documentation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring and leveling: participate in interviews, help hold the technical bar for the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or related fields and 6 years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in JavaScript (ES6+), CSS preprocessors, and HTML5, with demonstrated ability to make architectural decisions in this stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in and helping shape Agile processes for a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, including the ability to influence technical direction across engineering and product without formal authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous AdTech experience is highly valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing mobile applications&lt;/li&gt;
