&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This role offers a highly competitive compensation and benefits package in the alternative legal services marketplace, that includes health benefits, pension and more.&amp;nbsp; Axiomites also get access to professional development resources and learning and development programs. Axiom provides the opportunity to work remotely, onsite or hybrid, depending on client requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
